$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrtwsum  LOC_AFTER=?

* The Gauss-sum transfer (LargeSieve char_twisted_sum_eq): for coefficients supported on integers coprime to N, the character-twisted average over the coprime residues of the additive-character sums is the Gauss sum times the inverse-character-twisted coefficient sum.

